  panels:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4566cad7795a8eb43924919c7ac47f48, type: 3}
    dialogue: .........
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 117035728df4396499a6680d18c6d03b, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...!
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 117035728df4396499a6680d18c6d03b, type: 3}
    dialogue: Hey what are you doing!?
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: "We know what you\u2019ve done, Renatto. You\u2019ve been a very, very
      bad rat..."
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: " Whatever you\u2019re talking about, you\u2019ve got the wrong guy...!"
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 011ff9bc0f8527a4b8b01c2898ce6d36, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: This cheese tastes good, where did you get it?
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: "I bought some stuff from another enforcer of yours\u2026 *gulp*"
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: "If I had it my way, you would be dead where you stand, you\u2019re
      lucky the higher-ups are so nice\u2026"
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: Is it that I forgot to teach you, or is it that your brains went away
      when you started snorting all our cheese?
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: Shut it, kid, you know you can't buy from another one of our fucking
      sellers.
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Cheezus, back in my day, sellers had some depth to them. You new age
      freaks can't spend a minute away from cheese. You\u2019re fucking pathetic."
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: "I promise I\u2019m going to pay it all back, I just need some time."
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: "I promise I\u2019m going to pay it all back, I just need some time."
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: '*huffs* Yeah, how much time?'
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Just a few months, that's all, maybe around 4 months I can definitely
      get it back, I just need some more product and then I\u2019ll be good to go!"
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: That's the thing, Renatto ... .you won't be selling for us anymore.
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...! (N-No... I can't afford to lose this job! I won't be able to afford
      cheese anymore!)
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Oh, that's perfectly understandable actually, I\u2019m sure with the
      time I can find a way..."
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Yes, I'm sure in 4 weeks you will be able to\u2026"
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c32bd264546ffbe448c4c9a89d545baf, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...? I said four mo-
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Yes, four weeks\u2026"
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Boss, that's impossible, that much money\u2026 in 4 weeks. Please
      ive been working with you guys for years\u2026 give me some leniency, what
      am I supposed to do."
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: Perrhaps, you could be a man and figure it out, or be a woman and use
      that pretty mouth of yours.
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: I won't do-!
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 826f9bc2bd84e9f419a28a74c0abda58, type: 3}
    dialogue: 'You will. And if you don''t have the money...

      listen, you got
      four weeks buddy.'
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5300b5fbdfebf3f4e88c9f49812f99c5, type: 3}
    dialogue: I think this is a little bit of an incentive...
    speaker: ???
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5300b5fbdfebf3f4e88c9f49812f99c5, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...!
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1e22e2f0ce11faf4f9fa3a4482783396, type: 3}
    dialogue: '!!!

      !!!

      !!!'
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5b591cfa3b419a34ab24b3ebcaa5cda2, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...
    speaker: Renatto
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5b591cfa3b419a34ab24b3ebcaa5cda2, type: 3}
    dialogue: "Four weeks\u2026. That's impossible, I\u2019m never going to get enough
      in that time. "
    speaker: Renatto
